    "u8>(),\n        0,\n    );\n    if (r < 0)\n    {\n        return Err(code_error(r));\n    }\n    Ok(r)\n}ex"
    "port fn Option::unwrap_or<T>(Option<T> o, T d) : T\n{\n    match (o)\n    {\n        Some(v) : v,\n      "
