    "t;\n        if (*c > 0)\n        {\n            *c = *c + 1;\n            alive = true;\n        }\n    }\n"
    "    if (alive) { Some(Rc { .ptr = w.ptr }) } else { None }\n}unittest \"Weak::upgrade: after the last "
    "Rc\"\n{\n    Rc<String> a = Rc::new(String::from_str(\"shared\"));\n    Rc<String> b = Rc::clone(&a);\n    "
